Package: foosball3
Title: An App to Manage and Organise Foosball Tournaments
Version: 0.0.1.0005
Authors@R: c(person("Pepijn", "de Vries", role = c("aut", "cre", "dtc"),
    email = "pepijn.devries@outlook.com",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7961-6646")))
Author:
    Pepijn de Vries [aut, cre, dtc] (0000-0002-7961-6646)
Description: A relational SQLite database used to manage leisure
    foosball tournaments. This package provides a features and
    a graphical user interface to easily access the database. It
    also allows to visualise (historical) data and account player
    history. It can be used to facilitate a live tournament.
